  "title": "Q086 퀴즈 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "An on-premises Windows file application must retain an SMB interface while storing data in AWS. Which TWO services are candidates?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>퀴즈</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 086</p><h1>퀴즈</h1></div><strong>86 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"86번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:80%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q086\" data-question=\"Q086\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,4\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q086</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises Windows file application must retain an SMB interface while storing data in AWS. Which TWO services are candidates?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx for Windows File Server</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Amazon EFS over NFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot as a file share</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Route 53 Resolver</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, E</strong> · 관리형 Windows 파일 시스템에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체로 이어지는 하이브리드 파일 인터페이스에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q085/\">이전 문제 <b>Q085</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q087/\">다음 문제 <b>Q087</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
